  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1601.03 Prohibition on Use of Non-Conforming Fuels",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1601.03 Prohibition on Use of Non-Conforming Fuels. No person shall cause or allow the use of a non-conforming fuel in this state without first obtaining approval for such use in accordance with Env-A 1606.\n\nSource. #10415, eff 9-24-13 (formerly Env-A 1608.01); ss by #13808, eff 11-18-23",
